External dataset: Donjon ML-KEM EM dataset, described in ePrint 2026/1851. The locally recorded paper section 5 states GNU LGPL version 3 for the dataset; the inspected unmasked README files do not contain a separate license grant. The dataset and firmware are not included and are not relicensed by this artifact. Verify distributor notices when separately acquiring them.

NumPy, SciPy, scikit-learn, Matplotlib, threadpoolctl and their dependencies are separately obtained dependencies, not bundled code. Their licenses/notices remain with their distributions. Linked papers and license texts are not company-owned works. No rights to excluded material are granted here.
